  "aiContextParagraph": "The 49th ASEAN summit is currently being held in Manila, Philippines, serving as a platform for Southeast Asian nations to enhance regional influence and strategic collaboration. Key participants include leaders such as President Prabowo Subianto of Indonesia and Prime Minister Anwar Ibrahim of Malaysia, who have participated in diplomatic events including the 23rd ASEAN-India summit and official gala dinners hosted by the Philippine government. As the summit progresses, it is attracting significant attention from international powers, with various global leaders arriving to engage in regional dialogues. Notable preparations are underway for the anticipated arrival of US President Donald Trump, whose visit has prompted both official welcoming protocols and public demonstrations in the city. The event represents a critical period for ASEAN as member states navigate a complex international landscape while hosting major world figures.",
